        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-9310, Raised Beading Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 6 finishes, this beaded cabinet knob has a classic design that will add old world charm to any space. RK International's Plain Knob with Beaded Edge has a 1-1/2 inch diameter making it the perfect size for almost any small door or drawer.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/round-beaded-cabinet-knob-rose-rk-international-bp-7822\"><b>Round Beaded Cabinet Knob Rose</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/beaded-edge-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-2617\"><b>Beaded Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-9310 Beaded Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
